  "steps": [
    "Tear tofu into bite-sized pieces. Toss with cornflour, spices, soy sauce, salt, pepper and oil.",
    "Air fry at 200°C for 12–15 minutes, shaking halfway, until golden and crispy.",
    "Heat oil in a pan. Sauté onion and garlic.",
    "Add tomatoes, ketchup, spices and seasoning. Cook until jammy.",
    "Turn off the heat and mix in Greek yogurt until creamy.",
    "Add crispy tofu and coat generously in the sauce.",
    "Top with mozzarella, cover until melted and finish with chilli flakes and fresh herbs."
  ],
